flicts, political uncertainty and economic disruptions. Transforming them to work better for people and the planet is as urgent as ever. FAO, through its Investment Centre, collaborates with countries and a growing network of financing and knowledge partners to provide investment and finance solutions tailored to meet today’s challenges. This edition of the FAO Investment Centre Annual Review looks at the Centre’s achievements in 2024 – including marking 60 years of investment support – and priorities for the coming years.&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.format.numberofpages&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;f7309f9a-ab08-45b2-9b6f-b67a897c79fa&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;78 p.&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.uri&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;3c3af365-d3af-4fbf-82ea-48c910471657&q;,&q;language&q;:null,&q;value&q;:&q;https://openknowledge.fao.org/handle/20.500.14283/cd5352en&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.language.iso&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;8d5e962b-dc34-4431-985a-8312604016c0&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;English&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.publisher&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;b73907f8-b4e5-47e3-955c-5a7f8948d5b4&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO ;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.copyright&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;fb1b97a7-a8b5-489a-917c-dea04cab2406&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.license&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;f30cb677-34eb-4c4b-91ac-6afea0619990&q;,&q;language&q;:null,&q;value&q;:&q;CC BY 4.0&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;1ed0bef5-5d8c-478f-946a-35fc7e947aa0&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO Investment Centre – Annual review 2024&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.type&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;c4d4a9bc-30c3-492d