年消除饥饿和粮食不安全的目标（可持续发展目标具体目标2.1）相去甚远。同样，尽管已就各项全球营养目标取得一定进展，但仍无望实现可持续发展目标具体目标2.2。持续的食品价格通胀等因素已拖累了这一势头。《2025年世界粮食安全和营养状况》突出介绍多国的高通胀如何破坏购买力和健康膳食的获取，特别是低收入群体。报告介绍食品高通胀问题如何导致粮食不安全和儿童营养不良问题恶化。弱势群体，包括低收入家庭、妇女和农村人口，受食品价格通胀的影响最为严重，可能对为抗击饥饿和营养不良做出努力造成障碍。本报告分析了各国为应对以上挑战并预防未来价格冲击而采取的政策应对措施，同时概要指出前行方向。报告强调统筹实施财政和货币政策的重要性，以稳定市场，促进开放、有韧性的贸易，保护弱势群体。此外，报告呼吁加强数据系统，持续投资于打造有韧性的农业粮食体系，以实现长期粮食安全和营养。这些协调一致的行动必不可少，有助于为到2030年实现消除饥饿和营养不良的目标取得新进展。&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.format.numberofpages&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;e9c44088-90e3-4586-978d-6f23bdc80466&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;235 p.&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.eisbn&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;668f9423-f6fd-46d2-b368-3ba0266c82bb&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;978-92-5-140211-5&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.eissn&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;c67a0651-ba89-49f5-a650-5fc210a08b5d&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2663-8479&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.isbn&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;646927a6-5592-4d59-a378-f25e31f0f614&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;978-92-5-140125-5&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.issn&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;6aca2ec8-b915-4dcf-8c3f-f01ce7a2f5ec&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2663-8460&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.uri&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;d2a631f8-19f1-496d-90e5-80143358be9f&q;,&q;language&q;:null,&q;value&q;:&q;https://openknowledge.fao.org/handle/20.500.14283/cd6008zh&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.language.iso&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;0e14dcd7-6ff9-43f1-9bcf-461baed8e64d&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Chinese&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.publisher&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;7e54d4e9-962d-4271-afe8-d923554d0347&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;粮农组织 ; 国际农业发展基金 ; 联合国儿童基金会 ; 世界粮食计划署 ; 世界卫生组织 ;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.relation.ispartofseries&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;7e2e7383-d425-4b97-b3c2-3e37d0ac090b&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;世界粮食安全和营养状况&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.relation.number&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;23ded019-3c47-4cda-9b24-93553eb60888&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2025&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.copyright&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;dbfaccdc-5657-454e-b5f8-e0149fc92833&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.license&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;2e5638e1-afe5-4cdd-92b3-46ccd9adad92&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;CC BY 4.0&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;06ae497c-dc74-49b2-8f19-ad46f02b3152&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2025年世界粮食安全和营养状况&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title.englishtranslation&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;46253090-4e0e-4af6-99cd-30b4cdc3a753&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The State of Food Security and Nutrition in the World 2025&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title.subtitle&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;1276f5a0-cf29-4839-9284-932bf2bcf88a&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;应对食品价格高通胀，保障粮食安全和营养&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title.subtitleenglishtranslation&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;d2a592fa-4e0f-42cb-a70e-315230f84f37&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Addressing high food price inflation for food security and nutrition&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.type&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;03208209-4b23-4dcd-93e6-906e808b454a&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Book (series)&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.altmetricbadge&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;45f098d4-6c4b-4d00-969b-683559f84ed0&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Yes&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.cardvisibilitytype&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;b67054a2-156e-44aa-a54f-306fb9c4b30c&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Public&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.citation&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;1e7b6ba8-3267-43d7-9c9c-4f29a5d6d6be&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&l;div class=\&q;ExternalClass8A4FFBA4262E42BF8E3F83429A698F63\&q;&g;&l;p&g;粮农组织、农发基金、联合国儿童基金会、粮食署和世卫组织。2025。《2025年世界粮食安全和营养状况：应对食品价格高通胀，保障粮食安全和营养》。罗马。&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;/div&g;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.contentcategory&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;188d0325-7880-40bc-945d-8d698adba1d8&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Flagship&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.date.available&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;dff31042-570f-4aa3-87e6-020c271895b2&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2025-10-21T22:00:00Z&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.embargo&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;160a1fdb-a52b-41a1-b36e-e62b968e0102&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;No&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.fasttrack&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;aab15b02-729d-4a2f-8e73-6f40f7166513&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;No&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.identifier.doi&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;37ab60fb-5b3d-4185-a2cd-b4a9eef7f033&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;https://doi.org/10.4060/cd6008zh&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.identifier.jobnumber&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;f85a9010-9dd9-47a4-9d8e-04272703b0ac&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;CD6008ZH&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.identifier.pws&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;c36c97da-d713-45d5-ac74-84b9a54f2d76&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;331657&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.initiator&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;785c0842-b837-489c-bf04-2b940aef891f&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Verona, Daniela (ESA)&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.leadauthoringunit&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;adbe0dc8-bdcf-4511-b8ae-91a738312e05&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;ESA - Agrifood Economics and Policy&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.occnotes&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;3d23b6fa-2bd9-4ec6-8a04-401d0f45c415&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&l;div class=\&q;ExternalClass140BF9DC90984A28B2399A3CE8B71EA7\&q;&g;&l;p&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;As per English record&a;#58;&a;#160;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;Dear Laura,&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;I had sent a separate message yesterday confirming that FAO has no objection to the highlighted proposed text by the partners below&a;#58;&a;#160; (Resending it also from the copyright now and looping in everyone involved for their information)&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&l;em style=\&q;background-color&a;#58;#ffff00;\&q;&g;The terminology used to refer to countries, territories and areas as well as the representation of countries, territories and areas, including the delimitation of frontiers or boundaries, in this publication follow the institutional style and practice of FAO as the lead publishing organization, and may be at variance with those used by IFAD, UNICEF, WFP and WHO.&l;/em&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;English version of the In Brief already has this para included, so consider this cleared by the copyright.&a;#160; Kindly make sure that the highlighted section above is also included in the main report, digital report and all other language version of the In Briefs before they are published tomorrow.&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;If you need anything else from me, please let me know.&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;Kind regards,&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;Radhika&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&l;span style=\&q;color&a;#58;#000000;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;\&q;&g;Copyright&a;#58; FAO&l;/span&g;&l;span class=\&q;Apple-converted-space\&q; style=\&q;color&a;#58;#000000;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;&l;div&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;Logo&a;#58; IFAD, UNICEF, WFP and WHO logos cleared&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;AU&a;#58; FAO,&a;#160;IFAD, UNICEF, WFP and WHO&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;PU&a;#58; FAO, IFAD, UNICEF, WFP and WHO&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;FAO can sell&a;#58; yes&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;FAO doi&a;#58; yes&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p3\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;min-height&a;#58;15px;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;CC-BY 4.0 license&l;span class=\&q;Apple-converted-space\&q;&g;&a;#160;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p class=\&q;p2\&q; style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;normal;font-size-adjust&a;#58;none;font-feature-settings&a;#58;normal;font-stretch&a;#58;normal;font-family&a;#58;&a;quot;helvetica neue&a;quot;;color&a;#58;#000000;\&q;&g;&l;span class=\&q;Apple-converted-space\&q;&g;Additional text on copyright disclaimer cleared&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;&l;/div&g;&l;div&g;&l;span class=\&q;Apple-converted-space\&q;&g;&l;br&g;&l;/span&g;&l;/div&g;&l;p style=\&q;margin-bottom&a;#58;10px;line-height&a;#58;1.6;\&q;&g;&l;a href=\&q;/&a;#58;b&a;#58;/s/OCCP/EcbFLLFiA4xBg-SSy8TiNMoBFvPBZwbQqBcmUxpfVWzvvw?e=lfulf7\&q; style=\&q;color&a;#58;#0f6da7 !important;\&q;&g;